{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2bd014b0f62199f1fd42095b89aef8b52d9d5e75c1735f76570a1939584f1bf6","ja":"はい！　これからもあの笑顔に応えていきたいですね。\n体調管理にはさらに気をつけて、頑張らないと！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e3b173bff3122503717d24fb0d0e61b6dcbd549c96c81e437f7e04141c6c9c32","ja":"次は劇場に戻って公演、その次はひなたの故郷、\n北海道公演も控えてることですし♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"847e8ce9e5d94966da4efaa0a216a89d45db861dd4802a2aaa187d70503588de","ja":"えへへ……まさか今回のツアーで、\n北海道に行けるなんてねぇ……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ec1ce0bc46b5e79b54b3f9d6f41e16dd926f95e5924ca8c8bbacf09e86ec09af","ja":"北海道公演にはあたしの家族も見に来てくれるんだぁ。\nだからすっごく楽しみなんだよぉ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6ed9c26c7363345f8acf4dd3e6ef31eb8db57a2627dfd6b9a0e6c7d7137d364b","ja":"わあ～っ！　よかったね、ひなたっ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"02d5222284138dd64430a8ade4b4010d1f55dc8f60b04e92920f46537400bb22","ja":"そやな！　公演の後は、家族水入らずで\nご飯食べに行ったりするん？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"39b7d64865fb87b248277fd2a6c918f372b4e3c98d628e64764cbab74f3f93b2","ja":"ううん、それは難しいんだわぁ。だから、\n会場の近くで、ちょっこし会うだけかなぁ……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"48958e6f15f45126174fde65951b4cfda698cbbed3ce74677cf0b20d8f528054","ja":"それって……もしかして、移動時間の問題かしら？\n北海道って広いものね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"1650294ef21629448b8afba579a36a59e78d81b7d5be9eba56016786087ca9c5","ja":"うん。会場からあたしの家までは時間がかかる\nもんでねぇ……あんましゆっくりはできないんだわ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"9ff367d19515ba9f964ab4cd20a943210dca655fefe8931383d4f58a4c546e53","ja":"あたしが早く移動できたらよかったんだけど、\n到着はリハーサルの直前だし、仕方ないべさ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8abd0f63e197a5d5709ebeb671ce653e2bf4b2f7d47b0568012e6cc3b9b137ee","ja":"でも、せっかく北海道まで行くのに、\nちょっとしか会えないのは寂しいわよね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"96db06fe49ed1ddec631a8b739a30d9063c7b5c36513bad3df0d5d0431087125","ja":"ううん！　ちょっこしでも会えるだけでも、\nうれしいよぉ。顔が見られれば、十分なんだわ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
